<title>SOUTH AFRICA: VIERFONTEIN SAYS TALKS CONTINUING.</title>
<headline>VIERFONTEIN SAYS TALKS CONTINUING.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African coal firm Vierfontein Colliery Ltd (VCL) said on Monday that talks first announced in June concerning a possible restructuring were continuing.</p>
<p>The company said on June 2 that Ben Nevis Holdings Ltd had approached it with proposals which could result in a new business being placed in VCL.</p>
<p>Shareholders were urged to exercise caution in their dealings pending a further announcement.</p>
